  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 20630724608
    m_Localized: '<color=green>Objective:</color>

      Guide the AMAZEING BALL
      through the MAZE to the FINISH LINE as fast as possible, collecting as many
      stars as you can along the way. Complete all the levels to beat the game!



      <sprite
      index=5> <sprite index=0> Use the <color=green>LEFT/RIGHT ARROWKEYS</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> <sprite index=8><sprite index=8> to rotate the maze.



      The
      <color=green>FINISH TILES</color> will initially be locked. You''ll need to
      collect the <color=yellow>yellow key</color> to unlock them.


      <sprite
      index=1> Collect <color=yellow>YELLOW STARS</color> scattered

      <sprite
      index=8> around the maze.


      <sprite index=2> Avoid <color=red>RED STARS</color>
      -- collecting

      <sprite index=8> one will make you lose a star.

      <sprite
      index=8> If you collect one without any stars,

      <sprite index=8> the
      level fails.


      <sprite index=3> <color=#15C4FF>TELEPORTERS</color> will
      teleport the

      <sprite index=8> ball onto its pair with the same color.


      <sprite
      index=4> However, some of them may be locked Find the <color=#15C4FF>

      <sprite
      index=8> key</color> with corresponding color to

      <sprite index=8> unlock
      them.


      <sprite index=6> Also watch out for the <color=red>PITFALLS</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> as dropping the ball out of the maze

      <sprite index=8> will
      fail the level.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 8044773038083014681
  - m_Id: 536098103296
    m_Localized: '<color=green>Objective:</color>

      Guide the AMAZEING BALL
      through the MAZE to the FINISH LINE as fast as possible, collecting as many
      stars as you can along the way. Complete all the levels to beat the game!



      <sprite
      index=7> <sprite index=0> Tap the <color=green>LEFT/RIGHT SIDES</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> <sprite index=8><sprite index=8> of the screen to rotate the maze.



      The
      <color=green>FINISH TILES</color> will initially be locked. You''ll need to
      collect the <color=yellow>yellow key</color> to unlock them.


      <sprite
      index=1> Collect <color=yellow>YELLOW STARS</color> scattered

      <sprite
      index=8> around the maze.


      <sprite index=2> Avoid <color=red>RED STARS</color>
      -- collecting

      <sprite index=8> one will make you lose a star.

      <sprite
      index=8> If you collect one without any stars,

      <sprite index=8> the
      level fails.


      <sprite index=3> <color=#15C4FF>TELEPORTERS</color> will
      teleport the

      <sprite index=8> ball onto its pair with the same color.


      <sprite
      index=4> However, some of them may be locked Find the <color=#15C4FF>

      <sprite
      index=8> key</color> with corresponding color to

      <sprite index=8> unlock
      them.


      <sprite index=6> Also watch out for the <color=red>PITFALLS</color>

      <sprite
      index=8> as dropping the ball out of the maze

      <sprite index=8> will
      fail the level.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15627476525056
    m_Localized: 'Level 1

      Use <color=yellow>Arrow Keys</color> to move'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
